<div id="urduTextPath">مولا عباس (ع)/جب کٹ گئے دریا پہ علمدار کے بازو</div>
<p>jab kat gaye dariya pe alamdaar ke baazu<br>
shaanou se juda hogaye jarrar ke baazu<br>
reti pa gire shah ke ghamkhwaar ke baazu<br>
tharraane lage syed-e-abraar ke baazu<br>
____________________________<br>
 rang udhgaya tasweer-e-alam hogaye shabbir<br>
 sadma ye hua zof se kham hogaye shabbir<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>girne lagaa jis dam alam-e-syed-e-waala<br>
abbas ne jhuk kar ise gardan se sambhaala<br>
ek teer lagaa chashm pe aur seene pe bhaala<br>
bandh aankhe huvi mu se lahu sher ne dhala<br>
____________________________<br>
 ek gurz lagaa phir jo kisi aur shaqi ka<br>
 shaq hogaya sar hazrat-e-abbas-e-ali ka<br>
____________________________<br>
kuch guzar garaan baar ka sadmaa nahin thoda<br>
sar shaq huva phir mashk ko daanto se na chodaa<br>
zeen se jo gire aap khadaa hogaya ghodaa<br>
ek teer ne mashkize ko aur seene ko chedaa<br>
____________________________<br>
 paani jo bahaa eid huvi fouj-e-adu me<br>
 machli se tadapne lage abbas lahu me<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>nagaah ye aawaaz-e-ali dasht me aayi<br>
shabbir qabar lo ke tasadduq huva bhai<br>
chillayi ye zainab ke dohaayi hai dohaayi<br>
hazrat ne kahaa lutt gayi baba ki kamaayi<br>
____________________________<br>
tashreef shahe har do saraa laaye hai zainab<br>
 abbas ke laashe pe ali aaye hai zainab<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>yeh sunte hi hazrat ne amaame ko utaara<br>
akbar se kaha kar do garebaa'n ko dopaara<br>
aashiq mere bachhou ka zamaane se sidhaara<br>
hum sog me hai qatl huva sher humaara<br>
____________________________<br>
 aafat me phasi paani ki mohtaaj sakina<br>
bus hogayi duniya me yateem aaj sakina<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaake ye girte huve doude shahe waala<br>
sambhle kabhi khud kabhi akbar ne sambhaala<br>
tha seena-e-aqdas me kalejaa taubaala<br>
chillaati thi hai hai mere aaghosh ka paala<br>
____________________________<br>
jaldi kabhi chalte kabhi phir badte the shabbir<br>
ghabrake har ek laash pe gir padte the shabbir<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>kehte the uthaakar ye ali akbar-e-zeejaah<br>
darya ki taraayi to abhi door hai ya shaah<br>
farmaate the aankho me basaarat nahi aye maah<br>
abbas-e-ali chod gaye ab to hume aah<br>
____________________________<br>
 ab khenchenge talwaar jo rastaa na milegaa<br>
 akbar hume kya bhai ka laasha na milegaa<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>hazrat ko sambhale huve darya pe jo laaye<br>
abbas-e-alamdaar sisakte nazar aaye<br>
akbar ne kate haath tadapte huve paaye<br>
bhai ko khuda bhai ka laasha na dikhaaye<br>
____________________________<br>
jhukne jo lage kaampke ghash kargaye shabbir<br>
 sabit ali akbar pe huva margaye shabbir<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>hai hai shahe dee'n kehke jo roye ali akbar<br>
sadme se tadapne lage abbas-e-dilaawar<br>
ghabraake bhatije se kaha aye mere dilbar<br>
batlaado kidhar hai mere aaqa mere sarwar<br>
____________________________<br>
 akbar ne kahaa gham shahe waala ko bade hai<br>
woh aapke qadmou ki taraf ghash me pade hai<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>gash me ye suqan sunke pukaare shahe zeesha'n<br>
ye kiski sadaa hai mai is aawaaz ke qurbaa'n<br>
akbar ne kahaa kab se tadapte hai chachajaa'n<br>
mil lijiye ke abbas koi dum ke hain mehmaan<br>
____________________________<br>
phir ho na sakaa zabt imam-e-azali se<br>
 lipte shahe deen laasha-e-abbas-e-ali se<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaaye basad gham mere bhai mere bhai<br>
kya dil ka hai aalam mere bhai mere bhai<br>
kyu chashm hai purnam mere bhai mere bhai<br>
ukhdaa hai tera dum mere bhai mere bhai<br>
____________________________<br>
 seene m ajal saans teharne nahi deti<br>
 hichki tumhe kuch baat bhi karne nahi deti<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte hi hazrat pe qayaamat huvi taari<br>
abbas-e-alamdaar karaaye kayi baari<br>
atkaa jo dum aankho me to aansoo huve jaari<br>
tan rehgaya aur rooh sue khuld sidhaari<br>
____________________________<br>
chillaake jo sheh roye to ghabraayi sakina<br>
 nikla tha dum unka ke nikal aayi sakina<br>
____________________________<br>
mayyat se lipat ne ko jo wo doudti aayi<br>
hazrat ne abaa bhai ke chehre se hataayi<br>
chillaayi sakina ke dohaayi hai dohaayi<br>
reti me alamdaar ne shakl apni chupaayi<br>
____________________________<br>
tharraane lagaa laasha-e-saqqa-e-sakina<br>
 laashe se bhi aayi yeh sadaa haaye sakina<br>
____________________________</p>